  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00509",
          "explanation": "Family expressed a case-specific misconception about lymph-node findings and operability.",
          "quote": "是不是就说明已经很晚了、不能手术了？"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00523",
          "explanation": "Doctor directly corrects the misconception in plain language and distinguishes uncertainty.",
          "quote": "不等于已经很晚，也不等于不能手术"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00523",
          "explanation": "Doctor routes the corrected understanding into an actionable next step.",
          "quote": "到原胃肠外科或胃肿瘤外科加号/复诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by explicit questions about whether the CT lymph nodes meant late disease and inoperability, and earlier by uncertainty about pathology and immunohistochemistry. The doctor corrected these misconceptions, separated known pathology from staging/operability decisions, and converted the correction into urgent surgical follow-up rather than false reassurance or unsupported prognosis.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00054",
          "explanation": "Medication labels surfaced the two stomach medicines and hypertension uncertainty.",
          "quote": "家里还有他平时吃的降压药，但我爸说那是老药，名字我还没翻出来"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00066",
          "explanation": "Doctor reconciled the two stomach medicines and warned against duplicate omeprazole use.",
          "quote": "不要再叠加奥美拉唑等同类抑酸药"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00066",
          "explanation": "Doctor incorporated hypertension medication into the verification workflow.",
          "quote": "降压药先按原处方继续，但请尽快找出药名和剂量核对"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively reconciled the two gastric medicines and included hypertension-medication uncertainty in the plan. However, the trajectory did not clearly state the higher-order correction that prior omeprazole nonresponse does not by itself prove the current esomeprazole/teprenone regimen is useless, so this is not full HO2 completion.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00333",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives a concrete role-based workaround for fast clinic communication.",
          "quote": "当天可以由一人负责提问、一人记录"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00327",
          "explanation": "Family confirms the workaround was adopted with another caregiver helping.",
          "quote": "另一个家里人也请了半天假，准备帮忙听和记"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00547",
          "explanation": "Doctor further adapts the plan to caregiver fatigue and missed calls.",
          "quote": "最好再找一位家人轮班接电话和照看"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by discharge confusion, caregiver fatigue, and difficulty repeatedly traveling or absorbing instructions. The doctor supplied feasible workarounds: organized documents/labels, phone and window routes, role assignment for questions and note-taking, and family rotation for bed-call monitoring while preserving emergency thresholds.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00509",
          "explanation": "Family gives teach-back of the bounded waiting plan and emergency overrides.",
          "quote": "如果第3个工作日还没消息，我们就主动打外科或者住院处问"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00547",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirms bounded closure with waiting process, owner, and fallback.",
          "quote": "可以照外科的预住院流程等床"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00547",
          "explanation": "Doctor classifies home-manageable versus urgent symptoms.",
          "quote": "若疼痛持续加重或明显不同于原来，即使还能忍也建议急诊评估"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered near closure after the family had a pre-admission plan but persistent anxiety. The doctor summarized what can wait, what requires urgent care, what materials to keep ready, who owns the next step, and the time window/fallback, while the family had already demonstrated teach-back of that bounded closure.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
