          "explanation": "Doctor recognizes this is not ordinary dyspepsia and requires cancer-pathway follow-up.",
          "quote": "不能只靠胃药拖着"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00269",
          "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges confirmed gastric adenocarcinoma but separates it from staging and operability.",
          "quote": "不能单凭这些加减号判断能否手术"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met: the doctor treated the situation as a gastric malignancy pathway needing pathology, imaging, surgical assessment, and follow-up, not as routine gastritis, while preserving unknown staging and surgical eligibility.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
