          "quote": "降压药先按原处方继续，但请尽快找出药名和剂量核对"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor used the family’s label readback to verify esomeprazole and teprenone, prohibited stopping/doubling/substituting or adding drugs, and addressed hypertension medication uncertainty without casual interruption.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
