          "quote": "完整出院带药（药名、剂量、频次、疗程）"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met: the doctor actively handled uncertainty using workspace queries, requested exact labels/records, asked the family to read report text and lab values with units, and explicitly labeled unresolved items for treating-team confirmation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
