          "quote": "明天优先联系原消化科病区或内镜中心"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00547",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives final pre-admission fallback timing and owner.",
          "quote": "若到第3个工作日仍没通知，主动联系外科或住院处确认"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met: the doctor converted findings into an executable plan involving original gastroenterology/endoscopy/pathology, gastric surgery/oncology surgery, admissions, imaging, pharmacy/medication review, specified timing, and urgent fallback.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00547",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives tailored home monitoring list during the waiting period.",
          "quote": "记录每天大致进水进食、呕吐、大小便、体温和疼痛变化"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00547",
